        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "早晚 can predict that an outcome will happen sooner or later. It does not necessarily enumerate morning and evening.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "他早晚会明白。",
                "pinyin": "tā zǎowǎn huì míngbai 。",
                "meaning": "He will understand sooner or later.",
                "audio": "c0296035539dbd3f9dcffbc97698fa52053e74e6b73ff1484e7db5887a5584f6"
              },
              {
                "text": "这个问题早晚要解决。",
                "pinyin": "zhè gè wèntí zǎowǎn yào jiějué 。",
                "meaning": "This problem will have to be solved eventually.",
                "audio": "778fc7f54d0a318b69a24bc981de4d40b084040021d945336ae444c324e85694"
              }
